the close and adjusted close prices.

51
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:25,220
Now, when you download asset price data
from most sources, you usually won't be
able to get adjusted close prices.

52
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:33,380
And this is actually one of the reasons
