one of your existing stock sheets in this
file already.

152
00:19:53,180 --> 00:19:58,420
And just replace the data that you see in
columns A to G with some newly downloaded
data.

153
00:19:58,780 --> 00:20:03,100
That way, you're not going to need to go
through the whole process of building the
chart every time.

154
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:12,660
All you need to do is rename the sheet and
