00:40:36,880 --> 00:40:38,320
So that's the spread chart done.

348
00:40:38,320 --> 00:40:40,400
Let's move on to the ratio chart now.

349
00:40:40,400 --> 00:40:42,960
The process here is exactly the same.

350
00:40:42,960 --> 00:40:50,560
I'm going to start by inserting a 2D line
chart and then resizing the chart area to
something similar to the chart that we
just made.

351
00:40:51,280 --> 00:40:57,120
And after that, again, we need to add data
